<dialog id="radioChat" aria-label="HFG Radio chat"><div class="chat-heading"><span>CHAT</span><button id="closeChat" type="button">CLOSE</button></div><iframe title="HFG Radio chat" data-src="/index.php?view=chat"></iframe></dialog><section class="station-description"><p>HFG RADIO is an open platform for exchange, connection and experimental practice at HfG Offenbach. Initiated and run by students, the radio has become an integral part of the university over the past semesters. It offers an accessible space where students, teachers and guests can come together, share ideas and explore new forms of collaboration.</p><p>As an ongoing and continually growing project, HFG RADIO has become a platform that reaches far beyond the production of individual programmes. It is a place for listening, exchange and collective creation—and an important contribution to the open, experimental and collaborative culture of HfG Offenbach.</p><div class="cooperation"><p>Have an idea? Let’s collaborate.</p><a id="cooperationEmail" href="mailto:hfgradio@gmail.com" aria-label="Email hfgradio@gmail.com"><svg viewBox="0 0 1000 80" preserveAspectRatio="none"><text x="500" y="56" text-anchor="middle" textLength="980" lengthAdjust="spacingAndGlyphs">hfgradio@gmail.com</text></svg></a></div></section>